%% Thesis — xApp escalation per UE
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Normal
  Normal --> Isolated: fused alarm in 3 of 5 s
  Isolated --> Isolated: alarm continues (expiry refreshed, 3 s)
  Isolated --> Normal: no alarm for 3 s
  Isolated --> Blocked: isolated ≥ 10 s AND core alarm in 3 of 5 s (or core alone while KPM untrusted)
  Blocked --> Normal: expiry 120 s / admin reset
  note right of Blocked
    UPF refuses a block beyond
    maxBlockedRatio 0.5 (HTTP 403)
  end note
